    "teaching_notes": "This is a standalone review quiz — the student works through it independently. Questions cover all five chapter sections: parity (Q1-Q3), magic squares (Q4-Q6), Virahanka-Fibonacci sequence (Q7-Q9), cryptarithms (Q10), and algebraic parity (Q11-Q12). Questions shuffle on each attempt to prevent pattern memorisation. Explanations appear after each answer to reinforce learning. Use as a diagnostic tool to identify which topics need revision using the topic-wise breakdown on the results screen.",
    "instructions_for_student": "Test your understanding of the entire Chapter 6: Number Play! Answer each question by selecting the best option. After answering, read the explanation carefully — it connects back to the key concepts you learned. Try to get at least 10 out of 12 correct!",
